  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #6133, eff 11-30-95; ss by #7825, eff 2-8-03; ss by #9860, eff 2-8-11, EXPIRED: 2-8-19 New. #12732, INTERIM, eff 2-22-19, EXPIRES: 8-21-19",
